  "business": {
    "title": "Alphabet以搜索与视频广告为底盘，AI与云在重塑第二增长曲线",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "text": "Alphabet的可报告业务分成Google Services、Google Cloud和Other Bets；Google Services里又包括广告，以及订阅、平台和设备等非广告收入。其核心产品/平台覆盖Search、YouTube、Android、Chrome、Gmail、Google Play和Gemini。也就是说，公司不是单纯靠广告“吃流量”，而是围绕搜索、视频、移动生态、云与AI能力构建多条变现链条，但现金贡献重心仍明显在Google Services。",
        "kind": "fact",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000018",
            "index_id": "didx-028173790917c679",
            "block_id": "block-000077-0ba57163",
            "quote": ""
          },
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000018",
            "index_id": "didx-028173790917c679",
            "block_id": "block-000080-7bd7f443",
            "quote": ""
          },
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000018",
            "index_id": "didx-028173790917c679",
            "block_id": "block-000088-0c7f9036",
            "quote": ""
          },
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000018",
            "index_id": "didx-028173790917c679",
            "block_id": "block-000092-b1521a49",
            "quote": ""
          },
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000018",
            "index_id": "didx-028173790917c679",
            "block_id": "block-000093-9da7e695",
            "quote": ""
          },
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000018",
            "index_id": "didx-028173790917c679",
            "block_id": "block-000094-0a4cdc1c",
            "quote": ""
          },
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000018",
            "index_id": "didx-028173790917c679",
            "block_id": "block-000095-50fe9352",
            "quote": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "业务上最重要的不是“有多少产品”，而是这些产品如何服务于广告变现：管理层明确写到，Google Services主要通过Search、YouTube和Google Network上的绩效广告与品牌广告创收，并持续投入以提升广告可衡量性。由此看，Alphabet的优势仍是流量分发、广告技术和广告主效果闭环，而不是硬件销量本身。",
        "kind": "inference",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000018",
            "index_id": "didx-028173790917c679",
            "block_id": "block-000088-0c7f9036",
